Notes: A host class' first wrapper was freed by the old JS task's teardown.
After a successful transactional reset, the class/wrapper was re-registered
and evaluated with the same game-owned C ship fixture. The final JS task
shutdown caused the second release callback. Old JSValue handles are invalid
after task reset and must not be reused by original OOJavaScriptEngine callers.
All three tests executed on the native AC090 guest with RC 0. These gates
do NOT prove that the original complete OOJS class graph links against
javascript.library or that Oolite is playable.
